      <article class="card"><h3>Operations & people management</h3><p>Direct people management, workload and attendance coverage, workflow delegation, coaching, quality review, performance support, operational meetings, reporting, and cross-functional execution.</p><a href="/operations-leadership/">Operations & leadership →</a></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Customer success & SaaS leadership</h3><p>Customer relationships, technical support, escalations, training, software adoption, customer-lifecycle work, and leadership of a 32-person Customer Support and Technical Support organization.</p><a href="/customer-success/">Customer success experience →</a></article>
